<title>INDIA: Cricket-India A v South Africa scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-India A v South Africa scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>NAGPUR, India 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the last day of a three-day game between South Africa and an Indian A selection on Thursday:</p>
<p>South Africa 1st innings 384-5 decl</p>
<p>    India &quot;A&quot; 1st innings    340</p>
<p>South Africa 2nd innings (overnight 33 for no loss)</p>
<p>Brian McMillan	  c sub (Jaffer) b Bahutule  130</p>
<p>Herschelle Gibbs	c Jadeja	 b Raman     171</p>
<p>Nicky Boje		c Bahutule     b Nayyar     33</p>
<p>Lance Klusener	    not out			102</p>
<p>Hansie Cronje	     not out			 30</p>
<p>Extras (b-13,lb-7,nb-6)				   26</p>
<p>Total  (for three wickets at close)		  492</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-313, 2-324, 3-378.</p>
<p>Bowling: Ganesh 18-0-111-0 (nb-2), Sharma 4-1-9-0, Jadeja 13-2-39-0, Bahutule 28-2-114-1 (nb-1), Kapoor 15-0-69-0 (nb-1), Raman 7-0-34-1, Kambli 3-0-36-0, Nayyar 9-0-46-1 (nb-2), Sidhu 2-0-14-0.</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn.</p>
